---const urlEs = "/aviso-legal";const urlEn = "/en/legal-notice";---<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head>  <meta charset="UTF-8" />  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />  <title>Legal Notice | SelfHostDeck</title>  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />  <style>    * {      box-sizing: border-box;      margin: 0;      padding: 0;    }    body {      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;      background-color: #0f172a;      color: #e2e8f0;      min-height: 100dvh;      display: flex;      flex-direction: column;      align-items: center;      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem;      line-height: 1.6;    }    .container {      width: 100%;      max-width: 680px;      margin: 10vh auto auto auto;    }    .top-nav {      display: flex;      justify-content: space-between;      align-items: center;      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;    }    .btn-volver {      display: inline-flex;      align-items: center;      gap: 0.4rem;      color: #38bdf8;      text-decoration: none;      font-size: 0.95rem;      font-weight: 500;      transition: all 0.2s ease;    }    .btn-volver:hover {      color: #7dd3fc;      text-decoration: underline;      transform: translateX(-3px);    }    .lang-switch {      display: inline-flex;      align-items: center;      background: #131d31;      border: 1px solid #334155;      border-radius: 9999px;      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;      gap: 0.35rem;      font-size: 0.8rem;      font-weight: 700;    }    .lang-switch a {      color: #94a3b8;      text-decoration: none;      padding: 0.25rem 0.6rem;      border-radius: 9999px;      transition: all 0.2s ease;    }    .lang-switch a:hover {      color: #ffffff;    }    .lang-switch a.active {      background: #0284c7;      color: #ffffff;    }    .lang-divider {      color: #334155;      font-size: 0.75rem;      user-select: none;    }    h1 {      font-size: 2.25rem;      font-weight: 800;      color: #ffffff;      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;      letter-spacing: -0.025em;    }    .sub {      color: #94a3b8;      font-size: 1.05rem;      margin-bottom: 2rem;    }    .box {      background: #1e293b;      border: 1px solid #334155;      border-radius: 10px;      padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;    }    .box h2 {      font-size: 1.25rem;      font-weight: 700;      color: #ffffff;      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;    }    .box p {      color: #94a3b8;      font-size: 0.95rem;      line-height: 1.6;    }  </style></head><body>  <main class="container">    <div class="top-nav">      <a href="/en" class="btn-volver" id="btnVolver">        ← Back to catalog      </a>      <div class="lang-switch">        <a href={urlEs}>ES</a>        <span class="lang-divider">/</span>        <a href={urlEn} class="active">EN</a>      </div>    </div>    <h1>Legal Notice</h1>    <p class="sub">Terms of use, authorship, and platform liability framework.</p>    <div class="box">      <h2>1. Directory Purpose</h2>      <p>SelfHostDeck is an informational platform dedicated to sharing open-source software and self-hosted solutions. All analyses and configurations provided are strictly technical and for guidance purposes only.</p>    </div>    <div class="box">      <h2>2. Third-Party Software & Trademarks</h2>      <p>All brand names, logos, and registered trademarks mentioned on this website belong to their respective owners. Any reference to commercial software (SaaS) is made solely for comparative and functional reference purposes.</p>    </div>    <div class="box">      <h2>3. Technical Disclaimer</h2>      <p>Users are solely responsible for the deployment, configuration, and security of the indexed tools. SelfHostDeck assumes no liability for Docker container execution or the integrity of self-hosted data.</p>    </div>  </main><script is:inline>    const btnVolver = document.getElementById('btnVolver');    const paginaGuardada = sessionStorage.getItem('ultimaPaginaCatalogo');    if (btnVolver && paginaGuardada && paginaGuardada !== '1') {      btnVolver.href = `/en/${paginaGuardada}`;    }  </script></body></html>